<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">L. Zheng, W. Chiang, Y. Sheng, S. Zhuang, Z. Wu, Y. Zhuang, Z. Lin, Z. Li, D. Li, E. Xing, H. Zhang, J. E. Gonzalez, and I. Stoica</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">Judging llm-as-a-judge with mt-bench and chatbot arena</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_inbook">Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems</span>,  <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_editor">A. Oh, T. Naumann, A. Globerson, K. Saenko, M. Hardt, and S. Levine (Eds.)</span>,
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Vol. <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_volume">36</span>, <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_pages">pp. 46595–46623</span>.
</span>
