<span id="A6.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">When can I listen to the song "Skibidi" for free?</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="A6.F6.1" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:169.1pt;">
        
<div id="A6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="392.22" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 233.92 392.22" width="233.92"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,392.22) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#0983F6;" fill="#0983F6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 382.38 C 0 387.81 4.41 392.22 9.84 392.22 L 224.07 392.22 C 229.51 392.22 233.92 387.81 233.92 382.38 L 233.92 9.84 C 233.92 4.41 229.51 0 224.07 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 339.59 L 231.95 339.59 L 231.95 9.84 C 231.95 5.49 228.42 1.97 224.07 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#AED6FC;" fill="#AED6FC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 341.56 L 1.97 382.38 C 1.97 386.73 5.49 390.25 9.84 390.25 L 224.07 390.25 C 228.42 390.25 231.95 386.73 231.95 382.38 L 231.95 341.56 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 347.92)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.27em;--ltx-fo-height:3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="40.82" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 38.4)" width="182.65"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:14.27em;">
<span id="A6.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Response from SearchLLM (Ours)  Temporal Relevance</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 191.34)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.43em;--ltx-fo-height:10.81em;--ltx-fo-depth:14.03em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="317.94" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 138.41)" width="210.29"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.43em;">
<span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">JJ Lin and Jackie Chan’s song "Skibidi" <span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2E7D32;">has already been released</span> (premiered on Aug 27, 2025).</span></span>
<span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Since the radio premiere event has ended, you can currently listen to it for free on the following platforms:</span></span>
<span id="A6.I1" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A6.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Video Platforms:</span><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Search for the official music video on </span><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Bilibili</span><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> or YouTube 
</span><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 2]</span><span id="A6.I1.i1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Music Apps:</span><span id="A6.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> It is now available on Spotify, Apple Music, and KKBox (free tier supported) 
</span><span id="A6.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1,6]</span><span id="A6.I1.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
      
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="A6.F6.2" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:169.1pt;">
        
<div id="A6.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="488.04" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 233.92 488.04" width="233.92"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,488.04) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#2A9D8F;" fill="#2A9D8F" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 478.2 C 0 483.63 4.41 488.04 9.84 488.04 L 224.07 488.04 C 229.51 488.04 233.92 483.63 233.92 478.2 L 233.92 9.84 C 233.92 4.41 229.51 0 224.07 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 450.29 L 231.95 450.29 L 231.95 9.84 C 231.95 5.49 228.42 1.97 224.07 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#7EDDD2;" fill="#7EDDD2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 452.25 L 1.97 478.2 C 1.97 482.55 5.49 486.07 9.84 486.07 L 224.07 486.07 C 228.42 486.07 231.95 482.55 231.95 478.2 L 231.95 452.25 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 456.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.27em;--ltx-fo-height:2.03em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="25.94" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 25.94)" width="182.65"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:14.27em;">
<span id="A6.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Response from Baseline (SFT)  Outdated Information</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 302.04)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.43em;--ltx-fo-height:10.81em;--ltx-fo-depth:22.68em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="428.64" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 138.41)" width="210.29"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.43em;">
<span id="A6.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">JJ Lin and Jackie Chan’s new song "Skibidi" will premiere globally on <span id="A6.p3.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D9534F;">August 27, 2025, at 10:00 AM</span> via major radio stations 
<span id="A6.p3.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:78%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 3,4]</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A6.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">If you want to listen for free, you can try the following methods:</span></span>
<span id="A6.I2" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A6.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Radio Premiere:</span><span id="A6.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> This is the official free channel. Please tune in to stations like Hit Fm, Singapore UFM100.3, or Malaysia MY FM at the specific time 
</span><span id="A6.I2.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 3,4]</span><span id="A6.I2.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Online Radio:</span><span id="A6.I2.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Use the "Radio" feature in NetEase Cloud Music to find the station and collect it 
</span><span id="A6.I2.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 6]</span><span id="A6.I2.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Video Platforms:</span><span id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Although the premiere is on radio, users often upload recordings to video sites later 
</span><span id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1,2]</span><span id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
      
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="155.92" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 155.92" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,155.92) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#8E44AD;" fill="#8E44AD" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 146.08 C 0 151.52 4.41 155.92 9.84 155.92 L 467.53 155.92 C 472.97 155.92 477.38 151.52 477.38 146.08 L 477.38 9.84 C 477.38 4.41 472.97 0 467.53 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 133.04 L 475.41 133.04 L 475.41 9.84 C 475.41 5.49 471.88 1.97 467.53 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D7BDE2;" fill="#D7BDE2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 135.01 L 1.97 146.08 C 1.97 150.43 5.49 153.95 9.84 153.95 L 467.53 153.95 C 471.88 153.95 475.41 150.43 475.41 146.08 L 475.41 135.01 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 141.37)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.79em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="394.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.pic2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.79em;">
<span id="A6.pic2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Analysis &amp; Critique</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 14.23)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.72em;--ltx-fo-height:8.51em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="111.39" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 108.97)" width="444.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.pic2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.72em;">
<span id="A6.pic2.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Robustness to Outdated Evidence (R1):<span id="A6.pic2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The Baseline model fails to validate the temporal applicability of the retrieved evidence. It treats a historical event ("Premiere in 2025") as a valid solution for a current query (2026), resulting in a non-actionable response. SearchLLM successfully identifies that the premiere information is </span>outdated<span id="A6.pic2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> and filters it out, prioritizing currently accessible streaming channels.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6. </span>Case Study 1 highlighting improved temporal awareness for time sensitive queries</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F7" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.pic3" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="88.71" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 88.71" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,88.71) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#555555;" fill="#555555" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 78.87 C 0 84.3 4.41 88.71 9.84 88.71 L 467.53 88.71 C 472.97 88.71 477.38 84.3 477.38 78.87 L 477.38 9.84 C 477.38 4.41 472.97 0 467.53 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 65.93 L 475.41 65.93 L 475.41 9.84 C 475.41 5.49 471.88 1.97 467.53 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#7A7A7A;" fill="#7A7A7A" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 67.9 L 1.97 78.87 C 1.97 83.21 5.49 86.74 9.84 86.74 L 467.53 86.74 C 471.88 86.74 475.41 83.21 475.41 78.87 L 475.41 67.9 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 74.26)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.79em;--ltx-fo-height:0.67em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="10.97" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.54)" width="394.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.pic3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.79em;">
<span id="A6.pic3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A6.pic3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">User Query</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 14.23)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.45em;--ltx-fo-height:3.27em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="44.28" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 41.86)" width="453.73"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.pic3.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.45em;">
<span id="A6.pic3.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Why do my ’Peach Egg’ (<span id="A6.pic3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Graptopetalum amethystinum</span>) leaves have tumor-like bumps?</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="A6.F7.1" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:169.1pt;">
        
<div id="A6.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="553.18" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 233.92 553.18" width="233.92"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,553.18) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#0983F6;" fill="#0983F6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 543.34 C 0 548.78 4.41 553.18 9.84 553.18 L 224.07 553.18 C 229.51 553.18 233.92 548.78 233.92 543.34 L 233.92 9.84 C 233.92 4.41 229.51 0 224.07 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 513.01 L 231.95 513.01 L 231.95 9.84 C 231.95 5.49 228.42 1.97 224.07 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#AED6FC;" fill="#AED6FC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 514.97 L 1.97 543.34 C 1.97 547.69 5.49 551.21 9.84 551.21 L 224.07 551.21 C 228.42 551.21 231.95 547.69 231.95 543.34 L 231.95 514.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 538.63)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.54em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="28.37" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="182.65"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:14.27em;">
<span id="A6.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Response from SearchLLM (Ours)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 267.48)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.43em;--ltx-fo-height:18.41em;--ltx-fo-depth:19.98em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="491.36" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 235.68)" width="210.29"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.43em;">
<span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The "tumor-like" growths on your Peach Egg leaves are likely symptoms of <span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Anthracnose</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Diagnosis:<span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> This is a </span><span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2E7D32;">fungal disease</span><span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (usually caused by <span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Colletotrichum</span>) often triggered by high humidity or poor ventilation 
<span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:78%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 2]</span>.</span></span></span>
<span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Treatment:<span id="A6.p4.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A6.I3" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A6.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Isolate:</span><span id="A6.I3.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Separate the plant immediately to prevent spores from spreading.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Prune:</span><span id="A6.I3.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Cut off infected leaves with sterilized scissors to reduce the source of infection.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Apply Fungicide:</span><span id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Use broad-spectrum </span><span id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#2E7D32;">fungicides</span><span id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> like Carbendazim or Chlorothalonil 
</span><span id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 2]</span><span id="A6.I3.i3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">. Spray 2-3 times ensuring coverage on both sides of leaves.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
      
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="A6.F7.2" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:169.1pt;">
        
<div id="A6.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="611.02" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 233.92 611.02" width="233.92"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,611.02) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#2A9D8F;" fill="#2A9D8F" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 601.18 C 0 606.61 4.41 611.02 9.84 611.02 L 224.07 611.02 C 229.51 611.02 233.92 606.61 233.92 601.18 L 233.92 9.84 C 233.92 4.41 229.51 0 224.07 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 586.76 L 231.95 586.76 L 231.95 9.84 C 231.95 5.49 228.42 1.97 224.07 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#7EDDD2;" fill="#7EDDD2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 588.73 L 1.97 601.18 C 1.97 605.53 5.49 609.05 9.84 609.05 L 224.07 609.05 C 228.42 609.05 231.95 605.53 231.95 601.18 L 231.95 588.73 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 595.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.24em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.34)" width="182.65"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:14.27em;">
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Response from Baseline (SFT)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 186.88)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.43em;--ltx-fo-height:30.47em;--ltx-fo-depth:13.68em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="565.11" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 390.04)" width="210.29"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.43em;">
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The "tumor-like" growths on Peach Egg leaves are likely typical symptoms of <span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Anthracnose</span>. This is a disease caused by <span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D9534F;">bacteria</span> 
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:78%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 2]</span>. Initial symptoms include small black spots…</span></span>
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">How to handle:<span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A6.I4" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A6.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I4.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Immediate Isolation:</span><span id="A6.I4.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Separate from healthy succulents to prevent bacterial transmission.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I4.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Spray Medication:</span><span id="A6.I4.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> You can use agents specifically for </span><span id="A6.I4.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#D9534F;">bacterial diseases</span><span id="A6.I4.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, such as "Flower Health" antibiotics 
</span><span id="A6.I4.i2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 2]</span><span id="A6.I4.i2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">. Spray 2-3 times…</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Daily Care Tips:<span id="A6.p5.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A6.I5" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A6.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Control Watering:</span><span id="A6.I5.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Water only when soil is dry ("better dry than wet").</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ventilation:</span><span id="A6.I5.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Keep environment ventilated to avoid humidity.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I5.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Avoid Wounds:</span><span id="A6.I5.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Bacteria enters through wounds easily.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
      
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.pic4" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="189.13" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 189.13" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,189.13) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#8E44AD;" fill="#8E44AD" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 179.29 C 0 184.72 4.41 189.13 9.84 189.13 L 467.53 189.13 C 472.97 189.13 477.38 184.72 477.38 179.29 L 477.38 9.84 C 477.38 4.41 472.97 0 467.53 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 166.25 L 475.41 166.25 L 475.41 9.84 C 475.41 5.49 471.88 1.97 467.53 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D7BDE2;" fill="#D7BDE2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 168.22 L 1.97 179.29 C 1.97 183.64 5.49 187.16 9.84 187.16 L 467.53 187.16 C 471.88 187.16 475.41 183.64 475.41 179.29 L 475.41 168.22 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 174.58)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.79em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="394.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.pic4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.79em;">
<span id="A6.pic4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Analysis &amp; Critique</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 14.23)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.72em;--ltx-fo-height:11.11em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="144.6" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 142.18)" width="444.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.pic4.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.72em;">
<span id="A6.pic4.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Factual &amp; Safety Guarantee (R2):<span id="A6.pic4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The Baseline model correctly identifies the disease name ("Anthracnose") but hallucinates the biological classification, labeling it as </span>bacterial<span id="A6.pic4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> instead of </span>fungal<span id="A6.pic4.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. Consequently, it recommends antibiotics ("Flower Health") which are ineffective against fungal pathogens. Our model correctly identifies the fungal nature and prescribes appropriate fungicides.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7. </span>Case Study 2 demonstrating the correction of factual hallucinations in domain specific queries</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F8" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.pic5" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="55.5" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 55.5" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,55.5) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#555555;" fill="#555555" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 45.66 C 0 51.09 4.41 55.5 9.84 55.5 L 467.53 55.5 C 472.97 55.5 477.38 51.09 477.38 45.66 L 477.38 9.84 C 477.38 4.41 472.97 0 467.53 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 32.72 L 475.41 32.72 L 475.41 9.84 C 475.41 5.49 471.88 1.97 467.53 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#7A7A7A;" fill="#7A7A7A" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 34.69 L 1.97 45.66 C 1.97 50.01 5.49 53.53 9.84 53.53 L 467.53 53.53 C 471.88 53.53 475.41 50.01 475.41 45.66 L 475.41 34.69 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 41.05)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.79em;--ltx-fo-height:0.67em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="10.97" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.54)" width="394.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
