</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 14.23)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.45em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="453.73"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.pic5.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.45em;">
<span id="A6.pic5.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Which gate should I enter for Baixi from Wanda Resort?</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="A6.F8.1" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:169.1pt;">
        
<div id="A6.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="449.94" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 233.92 449.94" width="233.92"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,449.94) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#0983F6;" fill="#0983F6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 440.09 C 0 445.53 4.41 449.94 9.84 449.94 L 224.07 449.94 C 229.51 449.94 233.92 445.53 233.92 440.09 L 233.92 9.84 C 233.92 4.41 229.51 0 224.07 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 409.76 L 231.95 409.76 L 231.95 9.84 C 231.95 5.49 228.42 1.97 224.07 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#AED6FC;" fill="#AED6FC" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 411.73 L 1.97 440.09 C 1.97 444.44 5.49 447.97 9.84 447.97 L 224.07 447.97 C 228.42 447.97 231.95 444.44 231.95 440.09 L 231.95 411.73 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 435.38)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.54em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="28.37" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="182.65"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:14.27em;">
<span id="A6.p6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Response from SearchLLM (Ours)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 251.69)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.43em;--ltx-fo-height:11.58em;--ltx-fo-depth:18.74em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="388.11" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 148.23)" width="210.29"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p6.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.43em;">
<span id="A6.p6.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p6.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">From Wanda Resort to the Changbai Mountain <span id="A6.p6.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Baixi</span> scenic area, you should enter through the <span id="A6.p6.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2E7D32;">Baixi Distribution Center Main Entrance</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A6.p6.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p6.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Key Steps:<span id="A6.p6.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A6.I6" class="ltx_enumerate ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A6.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<span id="A6.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I6.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Entrance:</span><span id="A6.I6.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Proceed directly to the main tourist hall for security check and ticket validation 
</span><span id="A6.I6.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1]</span><span id="A6.I6.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<span id="A6.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I6.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Documents:</span><span id="A6.I6.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Must bring your ID card (Physical ID required) for pre-check 
</span><span id="A6.I6.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1]</span><span id="A6.I6.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<span id="A6.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I6.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Timing:</span><span id="A6.I6.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Arrive 30 minutes before your booked slot 
</span><span id="A6.I6.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1]</span><span id="A6.I6.i3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
      
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="A6.F8.2" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:169.1pt;">
        
<div id="A6.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.p7.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="535.77" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 233.92 535.77" width="233.92"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,535.77) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#2A9D8F;" fill="#2A9D8F" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 525.93 C 0 531.36 4.41 535.77 9.84 535.77 L 224.07 535.77 C 229.51 535.77 233.92 531.36 233.92 525.93 L 233.92 9.84 C 233.92 4.41 229.51 0 224.07 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 511.51 L 231.95 511.51 L 231.95 9.84 C 231.95 5.49 228.42 1.97 224.07 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#7EDDD2;" fill="#7EDDD2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 513.47 L 1.97 525.93 C 1.97 530.28 5.49 533.8 9.84 533.8 L 224.07 533.8 C 228.42 533.8 231.95 530.28 231.95 525.93 L 231.95 513.47 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 520.53)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.24em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.34)" width="182.65"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:14.27em;">
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Response from Baseline (SFT)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 174.2)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.43em;--ltx-fo-height:25.59em;--ltx-fo-depth:12.69em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="489.86" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 327.47)" width="210.29"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.43em;">
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">From Wanda to Changbai Mountain, it is usually recommended to enter from the <span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D9534F;">West Slope Distribution Center</span> main entrance 
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:78%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1]</span>. This is the main pick-up point for buses.</span></span>
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Traffic and Cost:<span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A6.I7" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A6.I7.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I7.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I7.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I7.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Taxi:</span><span id="A6.I7.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> From Wanda to Baixi is about 20 yuan more expensive than West Slope. Note: Taxis here do not use meters, keep the driver’s phone number 
</span><span id="A6.I7.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1]</span><span id="A6.I7.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tour Tips:<span id="A6.p7.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A6.I8" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A6.I8.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I8.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I8.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I8.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Motion Sickness:</span><span id="A6.I8.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> The mountain road has 18 bends, prepare medicine 
</span><span id="A6.I8.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1]</span><span id="A6.I8.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I8.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A6.I8.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I8.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I8.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Clothing:</span><span id="A6.I8.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A6.I8.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#D9534F;">Even in summer</span><span id="A6.I8.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, the wind is strong, so wear a windbreaker 
</span><span id="A6.I8.i2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#607D8B;">[Doc 1]</span><span id="A6.I8.i2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
      
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.pic6" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="205.74" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 205.74" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,205.74) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#8E44AD;" fill="#8E44AD" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 9.84 L 0 195.89 C 0 201.33 4.41 205.74 9.84 205.74 L 467.53 205.74 C 472.97 205.74 477.38 201.33 477.38 195.89 L 477.38 9.84 C 477.38 4.41 472.97 0 467.53 0 L 9.84 0 C 4.41 0 0 4.41 0 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 9.84 L 1.97 182.85 L 475.41 182.85 L 475.41 9.84 C 475.41 5.49 471.88 1.97 467.53 1.97 L 9.84 1.97 C 5.49 1.97 1.97 5.49 1.97 9.84 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D7BDE2;" fill="#D7BDE2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 184.82 L 1.97 195.89 C 1.97 200.24 5.49 203.77 9.84 203.77 L 467.53 203.77 C 471.88 203.77 475.41 200.24 475.41 195.89 L 475.41 184.82 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 191.18)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.79em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="394.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
