<td id="A6.T5.2.1.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" rowspan="2"><span id="A6.T5.2.1.11.3.1" class="ltx_text">Query</span></td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.11.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Query Satisfaction</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.11.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.11.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Basic intent alignment, avoids “answering B when asked A”.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Planning Quality</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Quality of reasoning and planning under uncertainty.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" rowspan="5"><span id="A6.T5.2.1.13.1.1" class="ltx_text">Evidence</span></td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Reference Beneficiality</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.13.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.13.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Evidence truly helps answer the question.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Reference Conflict</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.14.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Detects strong conflicts among evidence items.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Reference Irrelevant</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.15.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Detects evidence completely irrelevant to the query.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Reference Satisfaction</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Evidence covers primary and secondary needs.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Reference Diversity</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.17.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Promotes diverse evidence for robustness.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.18" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T5.2.1.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" rowspan="4"><span id="A6.T5.2.1.18.1.1" class="ltx_text">R3</span></th>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Richness</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.18.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Claim Diversity</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.18.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.18.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Rich and diverse answer claims.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" rowspan="3"><span id="A6.T5.2.1.19.1.1" class="ltx_text">Usability</span></td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Answer Useful</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.19.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.19.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Low fraction of off-topic content; conciseness.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Answer Firstness</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.20.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Places core answer early for quick consumption.</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T5.2.1.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Redundant Repetition</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">LLM-based</td>
<td id="A6.T5.2.1.21.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Controls severe semantic redundancy and rambling.</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
